        "general": {
          "comment": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Act 1 &amp; 2:</strong> You think everyone has gone mad&mdash;except you!</p>\n<p>That missing engineer clearly took his own life, and the rest is just a horrifying shared hallucination, a side effect of DeKompress.</p>\n<p>You have 10 doses of X-Stims with you.</p>\n<p>Your goal is to administer a dose to everyone, whether they want it or not, to calm them down and make them realize they are experiencing a mass hallucination!</p>\n<p>You show no symptoms yourself and must not use the drug on yourself. Its side effects might hinder your ability to act and save others.</p>",
            "label": "Text"
          }
