        "notes": {
          "notes": "<p>ARCTURIAN SWEET DREAMS&trade;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Derived from Arcturian hallucinogenic mushrooms, Sweet Dreams is a pleasure drug that causes you to see what you really want to see.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Take it and people around you will melt and change into others.</p>\n<p>Exposure to these mushrooms originally made humanity think that the Arcturians were shapeshifters of some kind.</p>\n<p>Sweet Dreams are sometimes used by intelligence personnel to gather information by convincing someone they are confiding in a friend or lover.<br /><br /></p>\n<p>A NOTE FROM MU/TH/UR:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>While it&rsquo;s not exactly illegal, the drug is restricted, very expensive, and can get you into a lot of trouble.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Just be careful when huffin&rsquo; these things&mdash;that poodle just might be a giant cockroach and that colonist&rsquo;s cute daughter just might be that burly grunt you owe $100 W-Y bucks to.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>price tag varies wildly across territories.</p>"
        }
